  "ruleText": "He-E 806.29 Bad Debts, Charity, and Courtesy Allowances. Bad debts, charity, and courtesy allowances shall not be included as allowable costs.\n\nSource. #8547, eff 1-24-06 (formerly He-W 593.13); ss by #10474, eff 1-24-14; ss by #14020, eff 7-10-24",
